  "instance_name": "performative_smiling",
  "label": "Performative Smiling as a Social Performance",
  "description": "The meme references the concept of 'performative smiling' — the act of smiling for the camera or in social situations even when one is not genuinely happy. This is often used to create a positive image or to conform to social expectations, and the meme uses this concept to mock or pressure the girls into smiling, even if they are not 'supposed' to.",
